: 1814, 'title': 'Preparing and Distributing Enumeration Assignments'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1815, 'title': 'GQE Enumeration Forms'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1816, 'title': 'Preparing Group Quarters Assignment Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1817, 'title': 'Supervisor Role'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1818, 'title': 'Enumeration'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1819, 'title': 'Procedures for In-Personal Interview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1820, 'title': 'Procedures for Drop Off/Pick Up'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1821, 'title': 'Procedures for Administrative Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1822, 'title': 'Review and Check in Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1823, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the field'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1824, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the SCO'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1825, 'title': 'Review and Check-in by the Clerk'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1826, 'title': 'Review of the SC-116, Special Census Group Quarters Control Record and SC-Q-GE, Individual Census Questionnaires'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1827, 'title': 'Item 1: All ICQs are original, not photocopies'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1828, 'title': 'Item 2: All ICQs have the GQ Case ID written on the back of the form'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1829, 'title': 'Item 3: The number of ICQs received for this GQ matches the Total Pop number written on the Control Record.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1830, 'title': 'Item 4: The Date Enumeration Completed box is filled in (Section C, Item 30 on the SC-116).'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1831, 'title': 'Item 5: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) or this GQ has incomplete ICQs, then there is documentation in the Notes section of the Control Record or an accompanying SC-225, INFO-COMM.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1832, 'title': 'Item 6: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) then there is a box marked in the *For Supervisory Use Only* section.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1833, 'title': 'Corrected and Error Free Control Records'}, {'children': [], 'id'