 'title': 'Section A -- the Group Quarters Facility Contact Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1136, 'title': 'Section B --Group Quarters Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1137, 'title': 'SC-351, Special Census Group Quarters Advance Contact Script'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1138, 'title': 'Group Quarters Advance Contact'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1139, 'title': 'Facility Name vs Group Quarters Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1140, 'title': 'Updating GQ Names or Collecting a New GQ Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1141, 'title': 'Enumeration Methods'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1142, 'title': 'GQ Type Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1143, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 501, 502, 701, 801, 802, 901, 902 and 903'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1144, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 901'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1145, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 999'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1146, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 703'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1147, 'title': 'Housing Unit'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1148, 'title': 'Out of Enumeration Area'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1149, 'title': 'Status Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1150, 'title': 'GQ Without a Scheduled Enumeration Appointment or No Longer Exist'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1151, 'title': 'Address Changes Guidelines for Existing GQs'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1152, 'title': 'Processing of GQAC materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1153, 'title': 'Group Quarters Adds and GQ Type Code Job Aid'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1154, 'title': 'Preparing and Distributing Enumeration Assignments'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1155, 'title': 'GQE Enumeration Forms'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1156, 'title': 'Preparing Group Quarters Assignment Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1157, 'title': 'Supervisor Role'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1158, 'title': 'Enumeration'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1159, 'title': 'Procedures for In-Personal Interview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1160, 'title': 'Procedures for Drop Off/Pick Up'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1161, 'title': 'Procedures for Administrative Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1162, 'title': 'Review and Check in Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1163, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the field'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1164, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the SCO'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1165, 'title': 'Review and Check-in by the Clerk'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1166, 'title': 'Review of the SC-116, Special Census Group Quarters Control Record and SC-Q-GE, Individual Census Questionnaires'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1167, 'title': 'Item 1: All ICQs are original, not photocopies'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1168, 'title': 'Item 2: All ICQs have the GQ Case ID written on the back of the form'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1169, 'title': 'Item 3: The number of ICQs received for this GQ matches the Total Pop number written on the Control Record.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1170, 'title': 'Item 4: The Date Enumeration Completed box is filled in (Section C, Item 30 on the SC-116).'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1171, 'title': 'Item 5: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) or this GQ has incomplete ICQs, then there is documentation in the Notes section of the Control Record or an accompanying SC-225, INFO-COMM.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1172, 'title': 'Item 6: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) then there is a box marked in the *For Supervisory Use Only* section.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1173, 'title': 'Corrected and Error Free Control Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1174, 'title': 'Reinterview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1175, 'title': 'Transitory Locations Advance Contact (TLAC) and Enumeration at Transitory Locations (ETL)'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1176, 'title': 'What is TLAC?'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1177, 'title': 'Transitory Locations (TLs) Defined'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1178, 'title': 'Transitory Units (TUs*)*'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1179, 'title': 'A TL consists of Sites, Slips, Pads, Spaces, Rooms, or Units'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1180, 'title': 'Special Census Office (SCO) Staff Duties'}, {'childre