rd'}, {'children': [], 'id': 469, 'title': 'Header Section'}, {'children': [], 'id': 470, 'title': 'Section A -- the Group Quarters Facility Contact Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 471, 'title': 'Section B --Group Quarters Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 472, 'title': 'SC-351, Special Census Group Quarters Advance Contact Script'}, {'children': [], 'id': 473, 'title': 'Group Quarters Advance Contact'}, {'children': [], 'id': 474, 'title': 'Facility Name vs Group Quarters Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 475, 'title': 'Updating GQ Names or Collecting a New GQ Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 476, 'title': 'Enumeration Methods'}, {'children': [], 'id': 477, 'title': 'GQ Type Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 478, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 501, 502, 701, 801, 802, 901, 902 and 903'}, {'children': [], 'id': 479, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 901'}, {'children': [], 'id': 480, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 999'}, {'children': [], 'id': 481, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 703'}, {'children': [], 'id': 482, 'title': 'Housing Unit'}, {'children': [], 'id': 483, 'title': 'Out of Enumeration Area'}, {'children': [], 'id': 484, 'title': 'Status Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 485, 'title': 'GQ Without a Scheduled Enumeration Appointment or No Longer Exist'}, {'children': [], 'id': 486, 'title': 'Address Changes Guidelines for Existing GQs'}, {'children': [], 'id': 487, 'title': 'Processing of GQAC materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 488, 'title': 'Group Quarters Adds and GQ Type Code Job Aid'}, {'children': [], 'id': 489, 'title': 'Preparing and Distributing Enumeration Assignments'}, {'children': [], 'id': 490, 'title': 'GQE Enumeration Forms'}, {'children': [], 'id': 491, 'title': 'Preparing Group Quarters Assignment Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 492, 'title': 'Supervisor Role'}, {'children': [], 'id': 493, 'title': 'Enumeration'}, {'children': [], 'id': 494, 'title': 'Procedures for In-Personal Interview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 495, 'title': 'Procedures for Drop Off/Pick Up'}, {'children': [], 'id': 496, 'title': 'Procedures for Administrative Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 497, 'title': 'Review and Check in Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 498, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the field'}, {'children': [], 'id': 499, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the SCO'}, {'children': [], 'id': 500, 'title': 'Review and Check-in by the Clerk'}, {'children': [], 'id': 501, 'title': 'Review of the SC-116, Special Census Group Quarters Control Record and SC-Q-GE, Individual Census Questionnaires'}, {'children': [], 'id': 502, 'title': 'Item 1: All ICQs are original, not photocopies'}, {'children': [], 'id': 503, 'title': 'Item 2: All ICQs have the GQ Case ID written on the back of the form'}, {'children': [], 'id': 504, 'title': 'Item 3: The number of ICQs received for this GQ matches the Total Pop number written on the Control Record.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 505, 'title': 'Item 4: The Date Enumeration Completed box is filled in (Section C, Item 30 on the SC-116).'}, {'children': [], 'id': 506, 'title': 'Item 5: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) or this GQ has incomplete ICQs, then there is documentation in the Notes section of the Control Record or an accompanying SC-225, INFO-COMM.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 507, 'title': 'Item 6: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) then there is a box marked in the *For Supervisory Use Only* section.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 508, 'title': 'Corrected and Error Free Control Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 509, 'title': 'Reinterview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 510, 'title': 'Transitory Locations Advance Contact (TLAC) and Enumeration at Transitory Locations (ETL)'}, {'children': [], 'id': 511, 'title': 'What is TLAC?'}, {'children': [], 'id': 512, 'title': 'Transitory Locations (TLs) Defined'}, {'children': [], 'id': 513, 'title': 'Transitory Units (TUs*)*'}, {'children': [], 'id': 514, 'title': 'A TL consists of Sites, Slips, Pads, Spaces, Rooms, or Units'}, {'children': [], 'id': 515, 'title': 'Special C