rd'}, {'children': [], 'id': 469, 'title': 'Header Section'}, {'children': [], 'id': 470, 'title': 'Section A -- the Group Quarters Facility Contact Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 471, 'title': 'Section B --Group Quarters Information'}, {'children': [], 'id': 472, 'title': 'SC-351, Special Census Group Quarters Advance Contact Script'}, {'children': [], 'id': 473, 'title': 'Group Quarters Advance Contact'}, {'children': [], 'id': 474, 'title': 'Facility Name vs Group Quarters Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 475, 'title': 'Updating GQ Names or Collecting a New GQ Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 476, 'title': 'Enumeration Methods'}, {'children': [], 'id': 477, 'title': 'GQ Type Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 478, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 501, 502, 701, 801, 802, 901, 902 and 903'}, {'children': [], 'id': 479, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 901'}, {'children': [], 'id': 480, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 999'}, {'children': [], 'id': 481, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 703'}, {'children': [], 'id': 482, 'title': 'Housing Unit'}, {'children': [], 'id': 483, 'title': 'Out of Enumeration Area'}, {'children': [], 'id': 484, 'title': 'Status Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 485, 'title': 'GQ Without a Scheduled Enumeration Appointment or No Longer Exist'}, {'children': [], 'id': 486, 'title': 'Address Changes Guidelines for Existing GQs'}, {'children': [], 'id': 487, 'title': 'Processing of GQAC materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 488, 'title': 'Group Quarters Adds and GQ Type Code Job Aid'}, {'children': [], 'id': 489, 'title': 'Preparing and Distributing Enumeration Assignments'}, {'children': [], 'id': 490, 'title': 'GQE Enumeration Forms'}, {'children': [], 'id': 491, 'title': 'Preparing Group Quarters Assignment Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 492, 'title': 'Supervisor Role'}, {'children': [], 'id': 493, 'title': 'Enumeration'}, {'children': [], 'id': 494, 'title': 'Procedures for In-Personal Interview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 495, 'title': 'Procedures for Drop Off/Pick Up'}, {'child