formation'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1797, 'title': 'SC-351, Special Census Group Quarters Advance Contact Script'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1798, 'title': 'Group Quarters Advance Contact'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1799, 'title': 'Facility Name vs Group Quarters Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1800, 'title': 'Updating GQ Names or Collecting a New GQ Name'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1801, 'title': 'Enumeration Methods'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1802, 'title': 'GQ Type Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1803, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 501, 502, 701, 801, 802, 901, 902 and 903'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1804, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 901'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1805, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 999'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1806, 'title': 'GQ Type Code 703'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1807, 'title': 'Housing Unit'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1808, 'title': 'Out of Enumeration Area'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1809, 'title': 'Status Codes'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1810, 'title': 'GQ Without a Scheduled Enumeration Appointment or No Longer Exist'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1811, 'title': 'Address Changes Guidelines for Existing GQs'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1812, 'title': 'Processing of GQAC materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1813, 'title': 'Group Quarters Adds and GQ Type Code Job Aid'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1814, 'title': 'Preparing and Distributing Enumeration Assignments'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1815, 'title': 'GQE Enumeration Forms'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1816, 'title': 'Preparing Group Quarters Assignment Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1817, 'title': 'Supervisor Role'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1818, 'title': 'Enumeration'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1819, 'title': 'Procedures for In-Personal Interview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1820, 'title': 'Procedures for Drop Off/Pick Up'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1821, 'title': 'Procedures for Administrative Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1822, 'title': 'Review and Check in Materials'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1823, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the field'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1824, 'title': 'Review Completed Materials in the SCO'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1825, 'title': 'Review and Check-in by the Clerk'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1826, 'title': 'Review of the SC-116, Special Census Group Quarters Control Record and SC-Q-GE, Individual Census Questionnaires'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1827, 'title': 'Item 1: All ICQs are original, not photocopies'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1828, 'title': 'Item 2: All ICQs have the GQ Case ID written on the back of the form'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1829, 'title': 'Item 3: The number of ICQs received for this GQ matches the Total Pop number written on the Control Record.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1830, 'title': 'Item 4: The Date Enumeration Completed box is filled in (Section C, Item 30 on the SC-116).'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1831, 'title': 'Item 5: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) or this GQ has incomplete ICQs, then there is documentation in the Notes section of the Control Record or an accompanying SC-225, INFO-COMM.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1832, 'title': 'Item 6: If the number of ICQs is 0 (zero) then there is a box marked in the *For Supervisory Use Only* section.'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1833, 'title': 'Corrected and Error Free Control Records'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1834, 'title': 'Reinterview'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1835, 'title': 'Transitory Locations Advance Contact (TLAC) and Enumeration at Transitory Locations (ETL)'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1836, 'title': 'What is TLAC?'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1837, 'title': 'Transitory Locations (TLs) Defined'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1838, 'title': 'Transitory Units (TUs*)*'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1839, 'title': 'A TL consists of Sites, Slips, Pads, Spaces, Rooms, or Units'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1840, 'title': 'Special Census Office (SCO) Staff Duties'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1841, 'title': 'Field Manager (FM)'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1842, 'title': 'Field Supervisor (FS)'}, {'children': [], 'id': 1843